"Bandit returns to Earth as a speaking beast with a posh accent and calls Nick Neek."
"He kills the dreadbeast tiger king and absorbs part of its power."
"The kill lifts him to Tier 2 with a Concept of shadow flame."
"One eye is a roiling black blaze with a yellow dot, and an arm, an ear and his tail are fire."
"Foreign memories from the power behind the dreadbeasts linger inside him."
"He can blink between shadows, even carrying others at huge mana cost."
"He can turn into living darkness, cloak himself in shadow flame and throw exploding clones."
"His shadow flame can choose not to burn whatever he wishes to spare."
"He is to lead the lemur tribe after its white-furred elder."
"His village is named Bandit is the Smartest Creature on Earth."
"He carries a light-drinking short sword that conducts shadow mana."
"He calls stamina guiding turbocharging, a word he likes."
"Nick gives him the brass spyglass Nick carried through the tutorial."
